Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), dh-python, pybuild-plugin-pyproject,
               python3-all, python3-setuptools
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/opengeofiction-net/danu

Package: danu-server
Architecture: all
Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${misc:Depends},
         python3-gdal, python3-numpy, gdal-bin, isofill, xz-utils, osmium-tool
Description: OpenGeofiction elevation pipeline
 Builds digital elevation models from the contour squares mappers draw, and
 publishes the hillshades, reliefs and contour extracts the tile servers render
 from.
 .
 This is the server half of Danu. The editor is packaged separately; both are
 built from the same source so that what an editor previews is what this
 produces.
